  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "2. Wrap the tofu in a paper towel and bake for 15-20 minutes, or until crispy.",
    "3. In a pan over medium heat, sauté the onions until caramelized, stirring occasionally.",
